WEBVTT

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.703
Are there dark, sinister parasites

00:09:01.703 --> 00:09:03.659
that are influencing our behavior

00:09:03.659 --> 00:09:05.234
without us knowing about it,

00:09:05.234 --> 00:09:08.053
besides the NSA?

00:09:08.053 --> 00:09:09.360
If there are any —

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.326
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:09:13.326 --> 00:09:15.648
I've got a red dot on my forehead now, don't I?

00:09:15.648 --> 00:09:18.175
(Laughter)

00:09:18.175 --> 00:09:21.129
If there are any, this is a good candidate for them.

00:09:21.129 --> 00:09:24.407
This is Toxoplasma gondii, or Toxo, for short,

00:09:24.407 --> 00:09:25.996
because the terrifying creature

00:09:25.996 --> 00:09:28.206
always deserves a cute nickname.

00:09:28.206 --> 00:09:30.488
Toxo infects mammals,